    next: 'Practice the cue with a few different safe objects and quiet rooms. Keep real hazards physically unavailable, and use a well-practiced trade if your dog already has an item.',
    sources: [{ label: 'RSPCA: teaching your dog to leave something alone', href: 'https://www.rspca.org.uk/adviceandwelfare/pets/dogs/training/leave' }]
