    image: './assets/training-settle.webp', alt: 'A dog resting on a mat beside a seated handler',
    overview: ['“Down” asks for a lying position. It is different from “settle,” which is a relaxed choice to rest.', 'Let your dog find the position without pulling legs or pressing shoulders. A lie-down may be uncomfortable for some dogs.'],
